    "detailed_description": "<h1>Buzz</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/cd39da2137d5e32ebecee69aa3d67554.avif?t=1727793332\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/d94118f1990222580f9c5eb5bbf4c265.avif?t=1727793332\" /></div><br>Follow the grim tale of young Amicia and her little brother Hugo, in a heartrending journey through the darkest hours of history. Hunted by Inquisition soldiers and surrounded by unstoppable swarms of rats, Amicia and Hugo will come to know and trust each other. As they struggle to survive against overwhelming odds, they will fight to find purpose in this brutal, unforgiving world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/d0755c926081c7942be430b81a42b18c.webp?t=1727793332\" /></div><br><br>1348. The plague ravages the Kingdom of France. Amicia and her younger brother Hugo are pursued by the Inquisition through villages devastated by the disease. On their way, they will have to join forces with other children, and evade swarms of rats using fire and light. Aided only by the link that binds their fates together, they will face untold horrors in their struggle to survive. As their adventure begins\u2026 the time of innocence ends. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/06f211246513719dff8fe7b61e7d5f9b.webp?t=1727793332\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/3a763b8cdb057f94aa9fb984c347a2d7.avif?t=1727793332\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/38f07694b9cad2310bced04c2a83f644.poster.avif?t=1727793332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/38f07694b9cad2310bced04c2a83f644.webm?t=1727793332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/38f07694b9cad2310bced04c2a83f644.mp4?t=1727793332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/d94118f1990222580f9c5eb5bbf4c265.avif?t=1727793332\" /></div><br>Follow the grim tale of young Amicia and her little brother Hugo, in a heartrending journey through the darkest hours of history. Hunted by Inquisition soldiers and surrounded by unstoppable swarms of rats, Amicia and Hugo will come to know and trust each other. As they struggle to survive against overwhelming odds, they will fight to find purpose in this brutal, unforgiving world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/d0755c926081c7942be430b81a42b18c.webp?t=1727793332\" /></div><br><br>1348. The plague ravages the Kingdom of France. Amicia and her younger brother Hugo are pursued by the Inquisition through villages devastated by the disease. On their way, they will have to join forces with other children, and evade swarms of rats using fire and light. Aided only by the link that binds their fates together, they will face untold horrors in their struggle to survive. As their adventure begins\u2026 the time of innocence ends. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/06f211246513719dff8fe7b61e7d5f9b.webp?t=1727793332\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/3a763b8cdb057f94aa9fb984c347a2d7.avif?t=1727793332\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/extras/38f07694b9cad2310bced04c2a83f644.poster.avif?t=1727793332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752590/e